{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Lina wakes up smiling because today is art day at school.","words":[[0,0.36],[0.43,0.71],[0.77,0.88],[0.96,1.49],[1.57,1.9],[1.95,2.23],[2.29,2.39],[2.48,2.77],[2.83,3.02],[3.08,3.18],[3.24,4.09]]},{"text":"At snack time, her banana drops on the floor, and she feels sad.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.27,0.6],[0.69,1.03],[1.08,1.2],[1.26,1.71],[1.76,2.11],[2.16,2.25],[2.3,2.37],[2.43,2.96],[3.29,3.47],[3.53,3.65],[3.73,4.05],[4.11,4.92]]},{"text":"Later, she cannot find her favorite crayon and feels frustrated.","words":[[0,0.59],[0.65,0.82],[0.91,1.25],[1.32,1.63],[1.71,1.85],[1.95,2.53],[2.6,3.05],[3.13,3.29],[3.38,3.71],[3.82,5.06]]},{"text":"Her teacher says, Feelings change, and that is normal.","words":[[0,0.22],[0.28,0.63],[0.7,1.15],[1.22,1.7],[1.75,2.24],[2.29,2.46],[2.52,2.68],[2.74,2.84],[2.93,3.81]]},{"text":"Lina looks in the mirror and notices her face changes with each feeling.","words":[[0,0.36],[0.43,0.71],[0.77,0.86],[0.92,0.99],[1.06,1.45],[1.53,1.7],[1.79,2.3],[2.38,2.52],[2.61,2.96],[3.02,3.56],[3.65,3.85],[3.92,4.16],[4.25,5.16]]},{"text":"She puts one hand on her tummy and takes three slow breaths.","words":[[0,0.21],[0.28,0.55],[0.63,0.84],[0.89,1.11],[1.2,1.3],[1.37,1.46],[1.52,1.87],[1.93,2.04],[2.11,2.44],[2.52,2.84],[2.9,3.25],[3.34,4.27]]},{"text":"Her shoulders relax, and her body starts to feel calm again.","words":[[0,0.21],[0.27,0.74],[0.81,1.32],[1.35,1.46],[1.53,1.6],[1.68,1.96],[2.02,2.36],[2.4,2.47],[2.55,2.79],[2.87,3.26],[3.33,4.09]]},{"text":"She tells her teacher, I felt upset, but now I feel better.","words":[[0,0.21],[0.28,0.59],[0.65,0.74],[0.81,1.37],[1.66,1.72],[1.86,2.11],[2.18,2.66],[2.71,2.87],[2.93,3.1],[3.18,3.2],[3.31,3.54],[3.61,4.37]]},{"text":"By playtime, Lina is happy again and ready to build with blocks.","words":[[0,0.22],[0.31,1.18],[1.43,1.73],[1.8,1.93],[2.03,2.38],[2.44,2.8],[2.88,3.03],[3.12,3.4],[3.46,3.55],[3.63,3.95],[4.03,4.24],[4.31,5.2]]},{"text":"Before bed, she remembers: feelings move like waves, and calm can come back.","words":[[0,0.5],[0.58,0.93],[0.95,1.09],[1.18,2.01],[2.3,2.8],[2.88,3.2],[3.26,3.5],[3.56,4.04],[4.09,4.25],[4.35,4.75],[4.83,4.99],[5.07,5.31],[5.35,6.04]]}]}